date":"2026-10-21","zh":""},{"title":"Longevity, Spooky Pictures, and Image Nation Multi-Picture Deal Sets ‘Deadstream’ Duo for Reddit Adaptation ‘Future Me’","src":"All Hallows Geek","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":""},{"title":"Reddit (NYSE:RDDT) - Stock Analysis","src":"Simply Wall Street","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE5xOVR3VlNyb3lKWDRtMl9idVV6TUVUaENoVUZ0S1Uzc2o4NUhGMDJVMURCS01YUlNVY3B0aU5iTUNZX3BSX2lzcmdlQ2dVS3lVZkczUzFkaHJaRmNVVl9HbHJrdVU?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Reddit (NYSE:RDDT) - 股票分析"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":4},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-06","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1713445/000171344526000022/rddt-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We built Reddit with the belief that communities unlock the power of human creativity and create a sense of belonging and empowerment for their members. Our over 100,000 active communities have channeled the power of human creativity to grow Reddit since our founding. We believe the world needs community more than ever, and that this represents our greatest opportunity to further enrich the lives of everyone in the world.","zh":"我們創建 Reddit 的信念是，社群可以釋放人類創造力的力量，並為其成員創造歸屬感和賦權感。自成立以來，我們超過 10 萬個活躍社群發揮了人類創造力的力量，推動了 Reddit 的發展。我們相信世界比以往任何時候都更需要社區，這代表著我們進一步豐富世界上每個人的生活的最佳機會。"},{"en":"Reddit is a global, digital city where anyone in the world can join a community to learn from one another, engage in authentic conversations, explore passions, research new hobbies, exchange goods and services, create new communities and experiences, share a few laughs, and find belonging. People are diverse and have multiple interests. Just like in a city, where citizens are part of multiple sub-communities, on Reddit, users often belong to multiple communities. At Reddit, users can dive into anything, and if a community does not already exist around a particular topic, they can create one. In the three months ended December 31, 2025, an average of 121.4 million daily active uniques (\"DAUq\") around the world came together on Reddit – continuously adding to our longstanding and constantly evolving human archive of information. They come together to share the rhythm of their daily discove","zh":"Reddit 是一個全球化的數位城市，世界上的任何人都可以加入社區，互相學習、進行真實的對話、探索熱情、研究新的愛好、交換商品和服務、創造新的社區和體驗、分享歡笑並找到歸屬感。人們是多種多樣的並且有多種興趣。就像在城市中，公民屬於多個子社群一樣，在 Reddit 上，使用者通常屬於多個社群。在 Reddit，用戶可以深入研究任何內容，如果尚不存在圍繞特定主題的社區，他們可以創建一個社區。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日的三個月內，全球平均有 1.214 億日活躍獨立用戶 (“DAUq”) 聚集在 Reddit 上，不斷豐富我們長期且不斷發展的人類資訊檔案。他們聚在一起分享日常發現的節奏"},{"en":"Communities on Reddit are organized based on specific interests and are called subreddits. Within subreddits, Redditors engage in active and in-depth conversations by sharing experiences, submitting links, uploading images and videos, and replying to one another in comment threads on any topic. Subreddits are denoted by an \"r/\" before their names: r/ explainlikeimfive helps people learn anything with child-friendly explanations; r/ lgbt helps people find their identity; and r/ BeyondTheBump helps people transition from pregnancy to parenthood. Redditors invest time to shape their communities, share their experiences, send support and supplies when someone is down on their luck, and even code scripts and develop tools to advance their communities.","zh":"Reddit 上的社群是根據特定興趣組織的，稱為 subreddit。在 Reddit 子版塊中，Reddit 用戶透過分享經驗、提交連結、上傳圖像和影片以及在任何主題的評論線程中相互回復來參與積極和深入的對話。 Reddit 子版塊的名稱前以「r/」表示：r/explainlikeim Five 可以透過適合兒童的解釋幫助人們學習任何內容； r/ LGBT 幫助人們找到自己的身份； r/ BeyondTheBump 幫助人們從懷孕過渡到為人父母。 Reddit 用戶投入時間來塑造他們的社群、分享他們的經驗、在有人運氣不好時提供支援和物資，甚至編寫腳本和開發工具來推動他們的社群發展。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We are competing for people's time and for global advertising spend. As such, we face significant competition across many areas of our business. People may choose to spend their time using other products when looking to fulfill the needs Reddit provides, such as being entertained, seeking information, diving into current events, exploring passions and hobbies, or peer-to-peer commerce. Examples of select competitors across several time spent categories include:","zh":"我們正在爭奪人們的時間和全球廣告支出。因此，我們在許多業務領域都面臨激烈的競爭。人們在尋求滿足 Reddit 提供的需求時可能會選擇花時間使用其他產品，例如娛樂、尋找資訊、深入了解時事、探索熱情和愛好或點對點商務。多個花費時間類別的選定競爭對手的範例包括："},{"en":"For Seeking Information—Google, Amazon, YouTube, Wikipedia, X, other news sites, and LLMs like ChatGPT, Gemini, and Anthropic.","zh":"用於尋找資訊 - Google、Amazon、YouTube、Wikipedia、X、其他新聞網站以及 ChatGPT、Gemini 和 Anthropic 等法學碩士。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Advertising","val":2062480000,"zh":"廣告"},{"name":"Other Revenue","val":140026000,"zh":"其他收入"}],"total":2202506000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":1785554000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":416952000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":2202506000}},"peers":["APP","CRWV","ARM","HOOD","NBIS"]}}